+    /// wrote down.
+    ///
+    /// Both bounds are printed for both columns, including the ones this build's read path never asks
+    /// about, because this is the line a log writes and a reader of a log is following *what a
+    /// decision was made from* — a zone that printed only the half it was asked about would be a
+    /// different value in the log than in the store.
